url: "https://www.richresults.ai/evidence.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stefanpetschinka/ai-visibility-evidence-model"
abstract: "A reference model that orders the publisher-side factors behind AI visibility by strength of evidence. It defines five factors (Topical Relevance, Machine Access, Entity Consistency, Extractability, Independent Corroboration) and assigns each a documented evidence grade based on peer-reviewed research and official platform documentation."
keywords:
  - "Answer Engine Optimization"
  - "AEO"
  - "AI Visibility"
  - "Generative Engine Optimization"
  - "Entity Building"
